2:T6af,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does SEO take to show results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most businesses see measurable ranking improvements within 60–90 days of technical and on-page work. Significant organic traffic growth typically develops from months 3–6 as content authority and link equity accumulate. SEO compounds over time — results in month 12 are significantly stronger than month 3."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work with businesses outside of ecommerce?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely — and this is important to us. Agentix provides SEO services across healthcare, legal, financial services, real estate, SaaS, professional services, home services, hospitality, B2B and many other industries. Our SEO methodology is adapted to your specific business model and buyer intent patterns."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What makes Agentix's SEO different from other agencies?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Three things: we combine technical SEO, content and link building as one integrated practice rather than siloed services; we are senior-led with no junior staff running your account; and we optimize for the revenue and lead generation metrics that matter to your business, not vanity traffic numbers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you measure SEO success?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Primarily by the business metrics that matter: organic leads, calls, form submissions or revenue — not just keyword rankings or traffic. We set up attribution tracking in the first month so every SEO gain is tied to actual business impact."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"SEO Strategy & Implementation\",\"description\":\"Full-service SEO strategy and implementation for 